<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Montgomery cuts CompUSA.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Montgomery cuts CompUSA.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities analyst Tom Courtney cut his rating on CompUSA Inc to hold from buy, his office said.</p>
<p>-- Courtney made no change in his earnings estimates for the company, which remain at $1.90 for fiscal 1997 and $2.35 for fiscal 1998, the office added.</p>
<p>-- The analyst's target price was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 3-1/4 points to 45-5/8 by mid-morning Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
